From 0e512c8b2565e19a88c554a0888d81581821bfe4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Link Dupont <link@sub-pop.net>
Date: Fri, 15 Aug 2025 13:57:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add D-Bus interface authorization

This commit introduces a new `DBusAuthorizationMixin` class and decorator that provides authorization functionality for D-Bus interfaces. The mixin is integrated into the `UserInterface`, `ChatInterface`, and `HistoryInterface`, ensuring that caller authorization is verified for various method calls. The methods now the thread-local sender_context to access the sender value, allowing for proper authorization checks based on the caller's user ID.
